2. Scalable Web App with NLB and Auto Scaling

Execution Steps
1.Launch EC2 instances
2.Configure application on instances
3.Create Network Load Balancer
4.Attach instances to target group
5.Configure Auto Scaling Group
6.Test application performance

Project Overview
Implemented a highly performant application using Network Load Balancer and Auto Scaling.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Network Load Balancer (NLB)
Auto Scaling Group

Features
Low latency traffic handling
High performance networking
Fault tolerance

Architecture
User → NLB → EC2 Instances
